pendent of all other streams.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Several consumers can each have a stream of their own, and all of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them get every transition. Cancelling the task of a consumer, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"letting go of a stream, ends only that stream.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The stream finishes when the state machine reaches an ending state,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after the transition leading there, as no further transitions will","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be made. A stream created at an ending state is finished from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"start. The stream also finishes if the state machine is deallocated.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create the stream before processing the events of interest, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hand it over to the task consuming it. A stream created by a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"task misses the transitions made before the task starts running."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["let transitions = await stateMachine.transitionStream()","","Task {","    for await transition in transitions {","        print(transition)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the transition received, and not "},{"code":"state","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", to know the state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entered. The state machine may have moved on since the transition."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a stream of the transitions made from now on, in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order they are made."}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/tr